    \"m_Content\": \"The Altitude Mask is black below the minimum altitude, transitions
    from black to white between the minimum and maximum altitudes, and then stays
    white above the maximum altitude.\",\n    \"m_TextSize\": 0,\n    \"m_Theme\":
    0,\n    \"m_Position\": {\n        \"serializedVersion\": \"2\",\n        \"x\":
    -1468.0,\n        \"y\": -60.0,\n        \"width\": 200.0,\n        \"height\":
